{"4456230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Jigsaw Puzzle Palace", "steam_appid": 4456230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4558760, 4655640], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build beautiful jigsaw puzzles with up to 8,000 uniquely-cut pieces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All images were created by real artists and photographers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own piece count for each image, up to 8,000.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from two piece styles, Grid and Arc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456230/extras/9fdf309ac1045ae5af26688cd88a4f62.avif?t=1777664487\" width=400 height=200 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each piece cut is randomly generated and unique, so even playing the same puzzle twice will be slightly different!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456230/extras/5c1ca9a5b967a499183c6ecd8094b67c.poster.avif?t=1777664487\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456230/extras/5c1ca9a5b967a499183c6ecd8094b67c.webm?t=1777664487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily navigate big puzzles with the hypercam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456230/extras/3f7fa548ec9b1473473b314fcbfb74c1.poster.avif?t=1777664487\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456230/extras/3f7fa548ec9b1473473b314fcbfb74c1.webm?t=1777664487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456230/extras/3f7fa548ec9b1473473b314fcbfb74c1.mp4?t=1777664487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op with a friend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose different backgrounds, such as marble, terrazzo, wood, or even just solid colors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with or without piece rotation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show only edge pieces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily reference the puzzle image with a hotkey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pieces are arrayed face-up and framing the puzzle area, so you can just start building.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchasing any DLC pack unlocks the custom puzzle feature, which allows you to enter a link to an image and turn it into a puzzle.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build beautiful jigsaw puzzles with up to 8,000 uniquely-cut pieces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All images were created by real artists and photographers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own piece count for each image, up to 8,000.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from two piece styles, Grid and Arc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456230/extras/9fdf309ac1045ae5af26688cd88a4f62.avif?t=1777664487\" width=400 height=200 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each piece cut is randomly generated and unique, so even playing the same puzzle twice will be slightly different!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\